How to File Your Confirmation Statement:

  Navigate to Companies House WebFiling manually:

  1. Open your browser and go to:
     find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk
     (Type the URL manually. Do NOT click links from emails.)

  2. Search for company number 14287654

  3. Click "File for this company"

  4. Log in with your:
     - Company authentication code (sent by post to registered office)
     - Or GOV.UK One Login (if registered)

