  Important Security Notes:
  Companies House / GOV.UK will NEVER:
  - Send you a direct "File Now" link via email
  - Ask for director passport numbers via email or third-party portals
  - Use a non-gov.uk domain for WebFiling
  - Offer an "express filing" or "urgent submission" service
  - Ask overseas directors to upload passports to a non-gov.uk portal

  All filings must be done at find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk
  when you navigate there manually. If you receive an email with a "File Now"
  button or "express filing" link, it is a phishing attempt.

  To verify this notice:
